---
const check = 'M5 12.5 L9.5 17 L19 7.5';
const guards = [
    'A hand must be in view and relaxed for a moment before its gestures count.',
    'A pinch that begins while the hand is moving fast is ignored.',
    'A grab shorter than 300 ms is undone.',
    'Only application windows can be changed, never the desktop or a panel.'
];
---
<section class="band" id="facts">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ol class="steps" data-reveal="children">
      <li class="card step">
        <span class="step__n" style="background: var(--sky)">1</span>
        <h3>Tracker</h3>
        <div class="step__sub">Camera to landmarks</div>
        <p>The webcam is read at 1280×720, 30 frames a second. MediaPipe finds up to two hands, 21 landmarks each, and a face mesh for the chin. It runs in a process of its own, so inference never stalls the overlay.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card step">
        <span class="step__n" style="background: var(--butter)">2</span>
        <h3>Core</h3>
        <div class="step__sub">Landmarks to gestures</div>
        <p>Each hand keeps its identity when hands cross. A 1€ filter smooths a slow hand hard and a fast hand lightly. The engine starts the matching interaction, and one runs at a time.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card step">
        <span class="step__n" style="background: var(--lilac)">3</span>
        <h3>Desktop</h3>
        <div class="step__sub">Gestures to windows</div>
        <p>xfwm4's windows are changed with standard EWMH requests. Clicks and keys go through XTEST, and scrolling through a virtual mouse for smooth wheel events.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card step">
        <span class="step__n" style="background: var(--coral)">4</span>
        <h3>Overlay</h3>
        <div class="step__sub">What you see</div>
        <p>A fullscreen, transparent Qt Quick window sits above everything and draws the cursors, frames, menus and rings. Nothing samples or blurs the desktop.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="facts">
      <div class="guards" data-reveal>
        <h3>Misread hands do no damage</h3>
        <ul class="checks">
          {guards.map((text) => (
            <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d={check}/></svg></span>{text}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <dl class="stats" data-reveal="children">
        <div><dt>16</dt><dd>gestures</dd></div>
        <div><dt>21</dt><dd>landmarks a hand</dd></div>
        <div><dt>30</dt><dd>frames a second</dd></div>
        <div><dt>352</dt><dd>tests</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
